   "title": "In which lane can you continue driving in the locality after being ahead of the truck?",
   "options": [
    "Right only",
    "Only on the left",
    "For any"
   ],
   "explanation": "The action takes place in a populated area on a road with two lanes in each direction. In this case, you have the right to use the band that is most convenient for you, i.e. any. (Clause 9.4 of the Traffic Regulations)",
